cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Version 1.2.0 is prepared for release; its Zenodo DOI will be added after archival."
title: "Exact Ray Trajectories in Anisotropic Media: Numerical Experiments"
type: software
abstract: >-
  NumPy experiments for exact ray trajectories in axially varying non-diagonal
  optical metrics, including independent geodesic integration, closed forms,
  endpoint inverses, Maxwell checks, and reproducible figure data. Version 1.2.0
  includes comparisons for five closed-form solutions at three parameter values
  each, paired ordinary and extraordinary rays, and the figure sources and PDFs.
authors:
  - family-names: Nishidate
    given-names: Yohei
version: 1.2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nsdt/ExactRayTrajectoriesAnisotropicMedia"
url: "https://github.com/nsdt/ExactRayTrajectoriesAnisotropicMedia"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - geometrical optics
  - anisotropic media
  - ray tracing
  - optical metric
  - numerical verification
